  "description": "Hit the trails with ease. Our ALLTRAIL 3 is the ideal eMTB for your first steps into trail riding. This touring full-suspension features a mullet setup, offering perfect traction on the climbs while remaining agile on the descents. The concept is simple yet brilliant: the 29″ front wheel provides stability, while the 27.5″ rear wheel lets you tackle tight corners with ease. With the Shimano 10-speed drivetrain, you’ll always find the right gear, even on varied terrain. And the powerful Yamaha PW-S2 motor gives you that extra boost when you need it. Maximum comfort is provided by the SR Suntour fork, offering 140mm of travel to handle even the toughest downhills. We’re confident that this eMTB will deliver maximum touring fun in any terrain, with a level of ease you’ve never experienced – even when things get bumpy.",
